            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "I expanded the config to :\r\n\r\n```\r\nrelative = 'cursor',\r\nwidth = 'auto',\r\nheight = 10,\r\nrow = 1,\r\ncol = 1,\r\nanchor = 'NW',\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor some reasons the defaults were sth like:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncol 240\r\nanchor SE\r\ntitle g\r\nrelative cursor\r\nfocusable false\r\nstyle minimal\r\nheight 10\r\nborder rounded\r\nwidth 10\r\nzindex 99\r\nrow 72\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I expanded the config to :</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"relative = 'cursor',\nwidth = 'auto',\nheight = 10,\nrow = 1,\ncol = 1,\nanchor = 'NW',\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">relative = 'cursor',\nwidth = 'auto',\nheight = 10,\nrow = 1,\ncol = 1,\nanchor = 'NW',\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For some reasons the defaults were sth like:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"col 240\nanchor SE\ntitle g\nrelative cursor\nfocusable false\nstyle minimal\nheight 10\nborder rounded\nwidth 10\nzindex 99\nrow 72\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">col 240\nanchor SE\ntitle g\nrelative cursor\nfocusable false\nstyle minimal\nheight 10\nborder rounded\nwidth 10\nzindex 99\nrow 72\n</code></pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "I expanded the config to :\nrelative = 'cursor',\nwidth = 'auto',\nheight = 10,\nrow = 1,\ncol = 1,\nanchor = 'NW',\n\nFor some reasons the defaults were sth like:\ncol 240\nanchor SE\ntitle g\nrelative cursor\nfocusable false\nstyle minimal\nheight 10\nborder rounded\nwidth 10\nzindex 99\nrow 72",
